  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "たさいな　きのうを　かくしもつ。\nゆびから　みずを　ふんしゃして\nせなかの　ひまくで　かぜに　のる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "다채로운 기능을 숨기고 있다.\n손끝에서 물을 분사하고\n등에 있는 피막으로 바람을 탄다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "身上隱藏著多種特殊能力，\n例如從手指噴射水流，\n以及用背部的翼膜滑翔等等。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il a plus d’un tour dans son sac : il peut tirer\ndes gerbes d’eau du bout de ses doigts et planer\ndans les airs grâce à ses membranes dorsales.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Zu seinen vielen geheimen Talenten gehört es,\nWasser aus den Fingern zu schießen und mit der\nMembran am Rücken durch die Lüfte zu segeln.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Esconde algunos trucos bajo la manga: puede\ndisparar agua por los dedos o planear con las\nmembranas de su espalda.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Ha vari assi nella manica. Emette getti d’acqua\ndalle dita e si fa trasportare dal vento grazie\nalla membrana che ha sulla schiena.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It has many hidden capabilities, such as fingertips\nthat can shoot water and a membrane on its back\nthat it can use to glide through the air.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "多彩な　機能を　隠し持つ。\n指から　水を　噴射して\n背中の　皮膜で　風に　乗る。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "身上隐藏着多种特殊能力，\n例如从手指喷射水流，\n以及用背部的翼膜滑翔等等。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Esconde algunos trucos bajo la manga: puede\ndisparar agua por los dedos o planear con las\nmembranas de su espalda.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "ゆびさきから　はなつ　みずでっぽうは\nマッハ３の　はやさ。　しゅんまくで\nきゅうしょを　みぬいて　うちぬくぞ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "손가락 끝에서 마하3의 스피드로\n물대포를 쏜다. 눈의 얇은 막으로\n급소를 간파해 꿰뚫어버린다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "能從指尖射出速度高達３馬赫\n的水槍。牠的瞬膜能幫助牠看穿\n敵人的弱點，準確地擊中要害。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il repère le point faible de l’ennemi grâce à sa\nmembrane nictitante, puis il transperce sa cible en\ntirant des jets d’eau à Mach 3 du bout des doigts.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Die Wasserschüsse aus seinen Fingern erreichen\nGeschwindigkeiten von bis zu Mach 3. Mit seiner\nNickhaut erkennt es Schwachpunkte des Gegners.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Dispara chorros de agua por la punta de los\ndedos a 3 mach de velocidad. Con su membrana\nnictitante puede ver los puntos débiles del rival.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Spara getti d’acqua dalla punta delle dita a una\nvelocità di Mach 3. Grazie alle sue membrane\nnittitanti individua i punti deboli del nemico.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Its nictitating membranes let it pick out foes’\nweak points so it can precisely blast them with\nwater that shoots from its fingertips at Mach 3.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "指先から　放つ　水鉄砲は\nマッハ３の　速さ。　瞬膜で\n急所を　見抜いて　撃ちぬくぞ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "能从指尖射出速度高达３马赫\n的水枪。它的瞬膜能帮助它看穿\n敌人的弱点，准确地击中要害。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Dispara chorros de agua por la punta de los\ndedos a 3 mach de velocidad. Con su membrana\nnictitante puede ver los puntos débiles del rival.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "めの　とくしゅな　レンズをつかってあいての　たいおんなどを　かんちしてきゅうしょを　みぬき　こうげきする。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "눈의 특수한 렌즈로 상대의 체온 등을 감지하고 급소를 찾아내서 공격한다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "會用眼睛的特殊晶狀體感知對手的體溫等情報，並在看穿要害後進行攻擊。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Ses lentilles spéciales lui permettent de détecter la chaleur. Il repère ainsi les points faibles de ses adversaires et les attaque.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Dank spezieller Linsen in den Augen erfasst es Faktoren wie die Körpertemperatur von Gegnern, erkennt so deren Schwachpunkte und greift an.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Gracias a las lentes especiales de sus ojos, es capaz de percibir la temperatura corporal del adversario y así atacar sus puntos débiles.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Attacca l’avversario dopo averne individuato il punto debole grazie alle speciali lenti sugli occhi, che captano dati come la temperatura corporea.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It uses special lenses in its eyes to sense things about its opponents—like their body heat—then attacks once it identifies a weak spot.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "目の　特殊な　レンズを使って相手の　体温などを　感知して急所を　見抜き　攻撃する。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "能用眼睛的特殊晶状体感知对手的体温等信息，并在看穿其要害后进行攻击。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Gracias a las lentes especiales de sus ojos, es capaz de percibir la temperatura corporal del adversario y así atacar sus puntos débiles.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "しんしてきな　ふるまいを　みせるがねっこは　なまけもののまま　なのでトレーナーが　みていないと　さぼる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "신사적인 태도를 보이지만 근본은 여전히 게으르기 때문에 트레이너가 보지 않을 때는 농땡이를 피운다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "雖然表現得很有紳士風度，但生性懶惰的部分依舊沒變，因此在訓練家沒看著牠時就會偷懶。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il agit de manière distinguée, mais c’est en réalité un partenaire toujours aussi paresseux qui flâne dès qu’on a le dos tourné.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es präsentiert sich gern gesittet, aber im Herzen ist und bleibt es ein Faulpelz. Lässt sein Trainer es aus den Augen, gönnt es sich eine Auszeit.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Muestra un comportamiento educado, pero en el fondo sigue siendo perezoso. En cuanto su Entrenador se gira, se pone a holgazanear.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Sfoggia modi signorili, ma in realtà è un pigrone che approfitta di ogni distrazione di chi lo allena per battere la fiacca.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It may present itself as being well-mannered, but deep down, it still has a lazy side. It will slack off when its Trainer isn’t looking.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "紳士的な　振る舞いを　みせるが根っこは　怠け者のまま　なのでトレーナーが　見ていないと　さぼる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "虽然表现得很有绅士风度，但它的本性仍然很懒惰，没有训练家盯着就会偷懒。",
